a98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蔡村田家","author":"高启","text":"田中耒声歇，烟火西林起。\n独立候归人，柴门夕阳里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17017,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦中作","author":"高启","text":"悠悠众扰去，寂寂孤吟歇。\n雨过满窗凉，高林上明月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17018,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"马周见太宗图","author":"高启","text":"封事朝闻夕拜官，新丰无复客衣寒。\n书生未有鸢肩相，只说君臣际会难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17019,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻旧教坊人歌","author":"高启","text":"渭城歌罢独凄然，不及新声世共怜。\n今日岐王宾客尽，江南谁识李龟年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17020,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中别宁公归西坞","author":"高启","text":"一上香台看落晖，沙村孤树晚依依。\n老僧不出青山寺，只有钟声送客归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17021,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋柳","author":"高启","text":"欲挽长条已不堪，都门无复旧毵毵。\n此时愁杀桓司马，暮雨秋风满汉南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":17022,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送贾麟归江上","author":"高启","text":"别泪纷纷逐断猿，贫交无赠只多言。\n离愁正似蘼芜草